	(text "Front panel\nButtons and headers only, so the panel can be swapped for any wiring.\nFit J602 for the SPI ST7789 (as on the Audio Kit build) or J603 for an I2C OLED\n(then fit R105/R106 on the main board). Check the module's pin order before soldering:\nOLED modules come as GND-VCC-SCL-SDA and VCC-GND-SCL-SDA.\nST7789: RST tied high (the driver sends a software reset), backlight always on.\nButtons pull to GND; pull-ups are on the main board / in the ESP32.\nJ604: status LED straight on (its 330R is R501 on the main board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
